Inhalt:
Wörter, die ich hasse 
Platz 1 Infrastruktur. 
Ich coache Politiker*innen, die fordern: "Wir brauchen mehr städtische 
Infrastruktur!" 
Sie meinen Mülleimer. MÜLLEIMER. Oder Kitas. Oder Spielplätze. So genau 
weiß das nämlich keiner. Genauso gut könntest du "Zeugs" sagen. Würden 
mehr Leute verstehen. 
“Nie ein langes Wort, wenn ein kurzes reicht.ˮ 
- George Orwell', '[-0.025436401,0.016952515,0.045532227,0.025634766,0.02760315,0.034698486,0.0524292,-0.025238037,-0.012718201,0.023757935,-0.040405273,0.049865723,0.034118652,0.023757935,-0.055999756,0.0335083,-0.0074424744,0.01763916,0.02760315,0.018630981,-0.03668213,-0.045135498,-0.055603027,-0.020507812,-0.014091492,0.006801605,-0.020599365,-0.013008118,-0.024734497,0.01084137,0.039611816,-0.03390503,-0.04888916,0.02079773,0.008872986,-0.015083313,0.014785767,-0.034484863,0.024536133,-0.013305664,-0.026016235,-0.024642944,0.006752014,-0.010253906,0.0031795502,-0.04711914,-0.011482239,0.0047073364,-0.013008118,-0.04534912,0.008430481,0.022079468,-2.771616e-05,-0.006652832,-0.042388916,0.0057907104,0.0040397644,-0.04397583,-0.03845215,0.05795288,-0.033721924,-0.020889282,-0.0021800995,0.056365967,0.04434204,-0.013504028,-0.029571533,0.015083313,-0.010253906,0.00881958,0.032714844,0.004558563,-0.062286377,0.032318115,-0.013801575,-0.04119873,0.023849487,0.013008118,0.030166626,-0.020599365,-0.052825928,0.020004272,0.052825928,-0.015670776,-0.0262146,-0.008872986,-0.008377075,0.019226074,0.00035119057,0.0014600754,0.029571533,0.004486084,-0.010498047,-0.020599365,0.032714844,0.0435791,-0.0335083,-0.0076408386,-0.006801605,-0.008132935,0.02178955,0.0025749207,0.10644531,0.02178955,0.03668213,-0.04888916,-0.0037708282,-0.012817383,-0.0046310425,-0.037261963,-0.06384277,-0.025817871,-0.0035972595,-0.062683105,-0.02168274,0.007980347,-0.02128601,0.0362854,-0.0725708,-0.049072266,0.036468506,0.018341064,-0.0054969788,0.007095337,-0.006702423,-0.03942871,-0.013702393,0.01626587,-0.006504059,-0.034301758,-0.0102005005,-0.03074646,-0.023849487,-0.040405273,-0.0362854,-0.010597229,0.0262146,-0.011581421,0.0062828064,-0.00091791153,0.02217102,-0.035491943,-0.042785645,0.015777588,-0.017837524,-0.0059394836,0.004928589,0.0026359558,0.0073432922,-0.0362854,0.011238098,0.02355957,0.056365967,0.034118652,0.0034503937,-0.046539307,0.007980347,-0.014884949,0.046142578,-0.00773620